{"version":1,"content":"<p>3間傳媒機構包括「香港01」、大公文匯傳媒集團旗下「點新聞」、聯合出版集團旗下「橙新聞」，以及油麻地公共圖書館，早前均收到可疑粉末信。</p><p>警方指，初步檢查相信該些粉末沒有爆炸危險。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.839765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T15:10:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:15:24.208285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:32.839765+00:00","content_hash":"11ae676ec1fee1abd828d7084ad9f161bc9e009b9c3f13feaa71561371c40409","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}